---
title: Project detail · display states
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Unknown
  Unknown --> Observed : observation ok
  Observed --> Unknown : observation failed
  state Observed {
    Stopped --> Starting : Start
    Starting --> Running : all ready
    Starting --> FailedStart : a service failed
    Running --> Degraded : a service down
    Degraded --> Running : service back
    Running --> Stopping : Stop
    Degraded --> Stopping : Stop
    Stopping --> Stopped : observed stopped
    FailedStart --> Starting : Retry
    FailedStart --> NeedsAttention : always-on gave up
  }
  note right of Unknown
    INV a failed or timed-out
    read never shows Stopped
  end note
  classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef fail stroke-width:2px
  class Running live
  class FailedStart,NeedsAttention,Degraded,Unknown fail
